---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ContactForm from '../../components/ContactForm.astro';
import Icon from '../../components/Icon.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Contact | Fabien Blasquez"
  description="Contactez Fabien Blasquez : formulaire, email contact@fabien-blasquez.dev ou LinkedIn."
  path="/contact/"
>
  <section class="contact-page">
    <div class="contact-grid">
      <div class="contact-intro reveal">
        <p class="eyebrow">Contact</p>
        <h1>Parlons de votre projet</h1>
        <p class="page-lead">
          Vous pouvez me joindre via le formulaire, ou directement par email ou LinkedIn.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-form-wrap reveal">
        <ContactForm />
      </div>

      <aside class="contact-aside reveal" aria-labelledby="contact-direct-title">
        <h2 id="contact-direct-title">Me contacter directement</h2>
        <ul class="contact-methods">
          <li>
            <a class="contact-method" href="mailto:contact@fabien-blasquez.dev">
              <span class="contact-method-icon"><Icon name="mail" size={22} /></span>
              <span class="contact-method-text">
                <span class="contact-method-label">Email</span>
                <span class="contact-method-value">contact@fabien-blasquez.dev</span>
              </span>
              <Icon name="arrow-right" size={18} class="contact-method-arrow" />
            </a>
          </li>
          <li>
            <a
              class="contact-method"
              href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/fabien-blasquez-4aa16636/"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              target="_blank"
            >
              <span class="contact-method-icon"><Icon name="linkedin" size={20} /></span>
              <span class="contact-method-text">
                <span class="contact-method-label">LinkedIn</span>
                <span class="contact-method-value">fabien-blasquez</span>
              </span>
              <Icon name="arrow-up-right" size={18} class="contact-method-arrow" />
            </a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <ul class="check-list">
          <li>Je vous réponds rapidement avec une proposition claire et des prochaines étapes.</li>
          <li>Un accompagnement direct, du premier échange jusqu'à une solution utilisable.</li>
        </ul>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
